flowchart LR
  dev[Developer]
  subgraph fe["Front end: React in browser windows"]
    rend[React windows]
  end
  subgraph be["Back end of the front end: Node in Electron main"]
    main[Electron main process]
    cache[(LokiJS cache)]
  end
  ide[IDE plugins]
  flowdir[("~/.flow folder")]
  api[Gridtime API]
  talk[Talknet server]
  mock[Local mock server]

  dev -->|uses| rend
  ide -->|write active.flow| flowdir
  rend -->|IPC events| main
  main -->|broadcast to every window| rend
  main -->|caches server data| cache
  main -->|settings and flow feeds| flowdir
  main -->|REST with X-API-Key| api
  main -->|socket.io| talk
  dev -.->|yarn dev:local| mock

%% Hover text for boxes and arrow labels, keyed by the label exactly as drawn.
%% tip: Developer :: The person whose coding flow the app tracks; also the developer running it from source.
%% tip: IDE plugins :: External plugins (not in this repo) that write activity feeds into ~/.flow/plugins.
%% tip: ~/.flow folder :: settings.json plus per-plugin flow feeds. Shared by the app and the plugins.
%% tip: React windows :: src/ — the front end. Draws the screen; asks the back end for data over IPC.
%% tip: Electron main process :: public/ — the back end of the front end. Web requests, sockets, files, jobs.
%% tip: LokiJS cache :: In-memory copy of server data so re-renders don't refetch. Memory only.
%% tip: Gridtime API :: The metrics/REST backend. Default URL is https://home.twilightcity.net.
%% tip: Talknet server :: Realtime socket.io server at https://talk.twilightcity.net.
%% tip: Local mock server :: server/Server.js — four /account endpoints on port 5000.
%% tip: uses :: The developer sees the console, status bar, Fervie and other windows.
%% tip: write active.flow :: Plugins append editor/execution activity to active.flow.
%% tip: IPC events :: The only bridge between the two halves: named events over ipcRenderer/ipcMain.
%% tip: broadcast to every window :: EventManager.dispatch sends every event to every open window.
%% tip: caches server data :: Fetched once, then served from memory until a reload.
%% tip: settings and flow feeds :: Reads settings.json, publishes and archives plugin feeds.
%% tip: REST with X-API-Key :: superagent requests with the stored API key in a header.
%% tip: socket.io :: socket.io-client connection keyed by a connectionId from login.
%% tip: yarn dev:local :: Starts the mock server, but the app ignores the SERVER= argument it passes.
